{% doc %}
  Marketing consent in the cart, right above the checkout button: on the cart page, and in the drawer
  too, because the drawer's button goes straight to checkout. Never required. The label is the theme
  setting "נוסח ההסכמה" (cart_marketing_label); the box shows while "תיבת הסכמה לדיוור"
  (cart_marketing_enabled) is on.

  Saved as the cart attribute "אישור דיוור", "כן" or "לא", which reaches the order's Additional
  details; the dashboard reads it there and updates the customer's marketing consent in Shopify. The
  key and both values are that contract, so they are written here, not in the locale file, where a
  wording change in the admin would break it.

  Checked when the attribute is "כן", or while it is still blank and "התיבה מסומנת מראש"
  (cart_marketing_preselect, on by default: the owner's decision) is on; unchecked otherwise. Both
  answers are saved, so a re-render never ticks a box the shopper cleared: @theme/cart saves every
  change (a cleared box saves its data-unchecked-value), and the checkout POST carries the answer
  either way: a ticked box posts "כן" (also a preselected one nobody touched), and for a cleared one
  @theme/cart adds "לא" to the form data. Without JavaScript a cleared box posts nothing, and the
  attribute keeps what it had.

  @param {string} [context] - 'drawer' (default) or 'page': the id (stable, so focus survives the re-render).
  @param {string} [form] - id of the form the box belongs to (the cart page's summary sits outside its form).

  @example
  {% render 'cart-marketing', context: 'page', form: cart_form_id %}
{% enddoc %}
{%- if settings.cart_marketing_enabled and settings.cart_marketing_label != blank -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign cm_key = 'אישור דיוור'
    assign cm_saved = cart.attributes[cm_key] | strip
    assign cm_checked = false
    if cm_saved == 'כן'
      assign cm_checked = true
    elsif cm_saved == blank and settings.cart_marketing_preselect
      assign cm_checked = true
    endif

    assign cm_id = 'CartDrawer-Marketing'
    if context == 'page'
      assign cm_id = 'CartPage-Marketing'
    endif
  -%}
  <label class="checkbox cart-marketing">
    <input
      type="checkbox"
      id="{{ cm_id }}"
      name="attributes[{{ cm_key }}]"
      value="כן"
      data-unchecked-value="לא"
      {% if form != blank %}form="{{ form | escape }}"{% endif %}
      {% if cm_checked %}checked{% endif %}
    >
    <span>{{ settings.cart_marketing_label }}</span>
  </label>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .cart-marketing {
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .cart-marketing a {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
